+# Plan: pre-generated message ids and persistence status on `done`
+
+## Constraints
+
+- Layering: domain must not import application/infrastructure/api (enforced by
+  tests/architecture/test_layering.py). Ids are generated in the application
+  layer with `pharma_agent.domain.shared.ids.new_id`.
+- The runner's own `done` payload and all other event payloads stay unchanged;
+  the session only adds keys.
+- `done` is always the last event of a session stream; no event follows it.
+- The answer is delivered even when saving fails.
+- Every task leaves `uv run pytest` (from `backend/`) green; tests are written
+  first and seen failing.
+
+## Task 1: `build_turn_messages` takes message ids
+
+- Files: modify `backend/src/pharma_agent/domain/conversation/turns.py`,
+  `backend/src/pharma_agent/application/chat/service.py` (temporarily generate
+  ids at the call site); update callers in `tests/application/test_queries.py`,
+  `tests/application/test_feedback_service.py`, `tests/api/test_conversations_api.py`,
+  `tests/application/test_summarize.py`.
+  Test file: `backend/tests/domain/test_conversation.py`.
+- Interfaces: provides `build_turn_messages(..., user_message_id, assistant_message_id, ...)`.
+- Done when: `test_build_turn_messages_uses_given_ids` passes (stored messages
+  carry exactly the given ids) and the suite is green.
+
+## Task 2: session ids, `conversation`/`done` payloads, result fields, no `error` event
+
+- Files: modify `backend/src/pharma_agent/application/chat/service.py`,
+  `backend/src/pharma_agent/application/progress.py`,
+  `backend/src/pharma_agent/domain/agent/run.py`,
+  `backend/src/pharma_agent/cli.py` (drop the `EventType.ERROR` branch so it still imports).
+  Test files: `backend/tests/application/test_chat_service.py`,
+  `backend/tests/api/test_chat_api.py`.
+- Interfaces: uses Task 1's `build_turn_messages`. Provides
+  `ChatSession.user_message_id` / `assistant_message_id`, the new
+  `ChatTurnResult` fields, and the `done` payload keys `persisted` and
+  `created_at` consumed by Task 3.
+- Done when: the updated service tests pass — ids distinct and exposed, first
+  event carries `message_id`, stored messages use the ids, `done` carries
+  `message_id`/`persisted`/`created_at`, persist failure ends with `done`
+  (`persisted=False`, `message_id=None`) and no `error` event, `EventType` has no
+  `ERROR`, `ErrorCode` has no `PERSIST_FAILED`; API tests see the new fields.
+
+## Task 3: CLI reports unsaved turns
+
+- Files: modify `backend/src/pharma_agent/cli.py`; README sentence on SSE events.
+  Test file: `backend/tests/test_cli.py`.
+- Interfaces: uses the `done` payload key `persisted` from Task 2.
+- Done when: `_render` tests pass — `done` with `persisted=False` prints
+  `!! Không lưu được lượt hội thoại này.` to stderr; `done` with
+  `persisted=True` or without the key prints nothing to stderr.
+
+## Final
+
+Run `cd backend && uv run pytest` and fix any failures.
